    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree traversal</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sort by key</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/vertical-order-traversal-of-a-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 987</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Vertical Order Traversal of a Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Give every node a coordinate (row, col), record one (col, row, val) triple per node with any traversal, sort the triples once, and cut the sorted list wherever the column changes. The whole tie-breaking rule is the sort key. O(n log n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
